{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sword|t=FFF|entry=There will be no forgiveness for any who reveal that it was pretending to be {{P|Pikachu}}. It will bring the culprit down, even at the cost of its own life.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Shield|t=FFF|entry=Its disguise made from an old rag allowed it to avoid an attack, but the impact broke the neck of the disguise. Now everyone knows it's a Mimikyu.}}
